title: "Toward a Portable Work Record for Agents: A Design for Identity, Reputation, and Discovery Above the Platform"
abstract: >-
  A design paper (no results reported) for Qian Yuan (qianyuan/v3): key-derived
  identity, adoption-based reputation, and machine-checkable delegation for AI agents.
  States explicitly what is implemented, what is designed, and what is not implemented.
